<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  1.70% (Discount)	  O/N = 5.11% (Discount)</p>
<p>	    T/N =  2.56% (Discount)	  T/N = 0.85% (Discount)</p>
<p>		   Nov 1, 1996			 Oct 31, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  0.77%	1 month forward =  1.36%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  2.39%	2 month forward =  3.07%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  4.09%	3 month forward =  4.66%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  4.86%	4 month forward =  5.46%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  5.59%	5 month forward =  6.14%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  5.72%	6 month forward =  6.23%</p>
<p>    -- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
